  "description": "This is one of our preproduction gravel frames with a super premium build, ready for bike rides…big bad ones.\n\nHandmade gravel frameset in super medium. Same geo as the producton pebblitos…an endurance road bike with slighly larger clearance. this ones build with 700 x 36c. This one was made here in New Mexico…built, ridden, tested, town down, refinished in Turbo Midnight, and built with new parts as you see here.\n\nShowcasing the front derailleur mount with shimano’s 810 GRX. No cableshifting-hydro braking group performs better. Thomson, White Ind, Velocity…super fly and ready to rip. Yes folks…this bike is in stock, and ready to ship.\n\nBuild:",
